{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/eddd78bc2726999feda924aaa88ab2ed.avif?t=1765316277\" width=610 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Redhowl</strong> is a top-down social deduction game that immerses you in the world of Little Red Riding Hood. Developed by the independent studio <strong>BENOM STUDIO</strong>, it\u2019s an online multiplayer game for 4 to 15 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll find yourself in Grandmother\u2019s village, deep within the Redhowl forest. Far from the idyllic childhood tale\u2026 Take on multiple roles to uncover within three factions: the Little Hoods, the Wolves, and the Voiceless. Only teamwork and your deduction skills will save the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/19f1b85572598cea780714fc4de2c758.avif?t=1765316277\" width=610 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Redhowl</strong> alternates between day, night, and council phases. There is also a Blood Moon, a nightmarish variant of the night phase. Each player has powers and objectives unique to their role and faction. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, the village thrives by completing daily quests assigned by Grandmother and ensuring everything runs smoothly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, the Hoods and Voiceless have limited vision, while the Wolves can transform and devour their prey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At dawn, the village gathers to share observations and deductions. When the council ends, each player votes alone, following their conscience. Then, everyone gathers in the town square to find out whether a player has been executed by the village.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/0e5cb2e03a614a75d0c8bfd23161ae13.avif?t=1765316277\" width=610 height=183 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Little Hoods Faction</strong> : The Hood, the Village Donkey, the Tax Collector, the Falconer, the Medium, the Revenant, the Politician, the Trapper, the Undertaker and the renowned Hunter !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Wolves Faction</strong> : The Wolf and the Fanatic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voiceless Faction</strong> : The Assassin.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique factions and roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable games : plenty of variations to suit your preferences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics : colors and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873330?t=1765316277","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/c46b1cc1c471d480fb1ae44957dbaa9eab736d9c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765316277","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/0525a877e5c4b619ec479dd29d12945bd482473a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765316277","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/0525a877e5c4b619ec479dd29d12945bd482473a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765316277","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/eddd78bc2726999feda924aaa88ab2ed.avif?t=1765316277\" width=610 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Redhowl</strong> is a top-down social deduction game that immerses you in the world of Little Red Riding Hood. Developed by the independent studio <strong>BENOM STUDIO</strong>, it\u2019s an online multiplayer game for 4 to 15 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll find yourself in Grandmother\u2019s village, deep within the Redhowl forest. Far from the idyllic childhood tale\u2026 Take on multiple roles to uncover within three factions: the Little Hoods, the Wolves, and the Voiceless. Only teamwork and your deduction skills will save the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/19f1b85572598cea780714fc4de2c758.avif?t=1765316277\" width=610 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Redhowl</strong> alternates between day, night, and council phases. There is also a Blood Moon, a nightmarish variant of the night phase. Each player has powers and objectives unique to their role and faction. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, the village thrives by completing daily quests assigned by Grandmother and ensuring everything runs smoothly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, the Hoods and Voiceless have limited vision, while the Wolves can transform and devour their prey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At dawn, the village gathers to share observations and deductions. When the council ends, each player votes alone, following their conscience. Then, everyone gathers in the town square to find out whether a player has been executed by the village.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/0e5cb2e03a614a75d0c8bfd23161ae13.avif?t=1765316277\" width=610 height=183 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Little Hoods Faction</strong> : The Hood, the Village Donkey, the Tax Collector, the Falconer, the Medium, the Revenant, the Politician, the Trapper, the Undertaker and the renowned Hunter !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Wolves Faction</strong> : The Wolf and the Fanatic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voiceless Faction</strong> : The Assassin.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique factions and roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable games : plenty of variations to suit your preferences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics : colors and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat</p></li></ul>","developers":["BENOM STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/5a06bc5d1319f54c8e221a6b4b1dc5b64f188a44/header.jpg?t=1765316277","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3873330/222858545/3b84740aa3478397bd35f93924a3e91d7c50424b/1764596062/dash_av1.mpd?t